<section class="px-8 py-20 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
        <h2 class="section-title max-w-3xl text-[2.3rem]">During the Virtual DLF Forum</h2>
        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-7">
            <div class="surface-card rounded-[1.6rem] p-7 md:p-8">
                <h3 class="font-headline text-[1.35rem] leading-tight tracking-[-0.025em]">Explore the full program.</h3>
                <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-on-surface-variant">
                    All Forum sessions are open to registered attendees, including DLF Working Sessions. You’re welcome to join a Working Session whether you’re already involved with a DLF Working Group, interested in getting involved, or simply want to learn more about their work.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="surface-card rounded-[1.6rem] p-7 md:p-8">
                <h3 class="font-headline text-[1.35rem] leading-tight tracking-[-0.025em]">Participate in the way that works for you.</h3>
                <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-on-surface-variant">
                    Virtual conferencing can be a lot! It’s completely okay to leave a session that isn’t what you expected, skip a session, step away from your screen, or take a break when you need one. You do not need to attend every session to have a meaningful Forum experience.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="surface-card rounded-[1.6rem] p-7 md:p-8">
                <h3 class="font-headline text-[1.35rem] leading-tight tracking-[-0.025em]">Build your schedule in Zoom Events.</h3>
                <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-on-surface-variant">
                    Use the Forum program and Zoom Events platform to identify the sessions you’re most interested in and create an itinerary that works for you. You can move between sessions throughout the event.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="surface-card rounded-[1.6rem] p-7 md:p-8">
                <h3 class="font-headline text-[1.35rem] leading-tight tracking-[-0.025em]">Join the conversation.</h3>
                <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-on-surface-variant">
                    Attendees are encouraged to participate through session discussions, Q&amp;A, and Zoom chat. Digital Storytelling sessions are especially designed to invite conversation and reflection between presenters and attendees.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="border-y border-outline-variant/30 bg-surface-container-low/55 px-8 py-20 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
        <h2 class="section-title max-w-3xl text-[2.3rem]">Shared Notes and Session Materials</h2>
        <div class="mt-10 max-w-3xl space-y-6 text-[1.05rem] leading-8 text-on-surface-variant">
            <p>
                <strong class="text-on-surface">Shared Notes</strong> 2026 Virtual Forum Shared Notes. Collaborate on session notes, share helpful links and resources, or catch up on something you missed in our 2026 Virtual Forum Shared Notes folder at <a class="break-words font-semibold text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-primary/80" href="https://bit.ly/VIRTUAL2026NOTES">https://bit.ly/VIRTUAL2026NOTES</a>. Navigate to the day and session number. We'll also share the Doc link in the chat of each session.
            </p>
            <p>
                Presenters are encouraged to share slides and other presentation materials through DLF’s Zenodo community. <a class="font-semibold text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-primary/80" href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MNqVq4-JjcO6l8giBRWwGfn467cWpiAN683eaaPNz3U/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.y88whv79eos">Zenodo Instructions for DLF Presenters 2026</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="px-8 py-20 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
        <h2 class="section-title max-w-3xl text-[2.3rem]">Community Care and Support</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-[1.05rem] leading-8 text-on-surface-variant">
            <strong class="text-on-surface">Help us maintain a welcoming community.</strong> Everyone participating in the Forum is expected to follow the <a class="font-semibold text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-primary/80" href="https://www.diglib.org/about/code-of-conduct/">DLF Code of Conduct</a>. Please help us create an environment where attendees, presenters, Fellows, volunteers, and staff can participate respectfully and fully.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-7">
            <div class="surface-card rounded-[1.6rem] p-7 md:p-8">
                <h3 class="font-headline text-[1.35rem] leading-tight tracking-[-0.025em]">Code of Conduct or emergency concerns.</h3>
                <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-on-surface-variant">
                    Contact DLF’s emergency/Code of Conduct line at <a class="font-semibold text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-primary/80" href="tel:+17327377328">(732) 737-7328</a> (732-RESPECT). This number will be continuously monitored by CLIR/DLF staff during the Forum from 7:00 a.m.–9:00 p.m. ET.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="surface-card rounded-[1.6rem] p-7 md:p-8">
                <h3 class="font-headline text-[1.35rem] leading-tight tracking-[-0.025em]">Need general help during the Forum?</h3>
                <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-on-surface-variant">
                    CLIR/DLF staff and our event team will be available throughout the event to assist with questions or technical issues. You can also email <a class="font-semibold text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-primary/80" href="mailto:forum@diglib.org">forum@diglib.org</a>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
